<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets warrants on the MIB 30 index.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets warrants on the MIB 30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued 15 million American-style call warrants, in six equal tranches, on the MIB 30 index, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE   ISS PRICE  PREMIUM     GEARING   MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    16,000   1.01 DEM    8.22 PCT   15.86 X   18.JUL.97</p>
<p> CALL B    17,000   0.59 DEM   11.96 PCT   27.15 X   18.JUL.97</p>
<p> CALL C    18,000   0.31 DEM   16.58 PCT   51.68 X   18.JUL.97</p>
<p> CALL D    16,000   1.44 DEM   10.90 PCT   11.13 X   19.DEC.97</p>
<p> CALL E    17,000   0.97 DEM   14.34 PCT   16.52 X   19.DEC.97</p>
<p> CALL F    18,000   0.62 DEM   18.52 PCT   25.84 X   19.DEC.97</p>
<p> PAYDATE 17.DEC.96    LISTING FFT STG DDF    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  15,700</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
